        <detaileddescription>
<para>Read a value with the specified consistency level.</para>
<para>Automatic routing rules: STRONG – served only if local staleness == 0. BOUNDED_STALENESS – served only if local staleness &lt;= max_staleness_ms. SESSION – served only if local sequence &gt;= token sequence. EVENTUAL – always served.</para>
<para>Returns std::nullopt when the consistency constraint cannot be satisfied by the local region (caller should retry or relax the level).</para>
